  "watch": {
    "gap": 0.5,
    "text": "Watch a paragraph vanish at six forty-three, and return two minutes later. See how long a bad edit survives: fifteen minutes. Find every number that quietly changed. Find the claim that waited nineteen years for a source. Watch a war change its name. Catch three languages disagreeing over a birthday. And ask who was president on one single day: the answer depends on which year's Wikipedia you ask.",
